#: ../../intl.rst:3
msgid "Internationalization"
msgstr "国际化"

#: ../../intl.rst:6
msgid ""
"Translate the explanation while keeping its structure. Guidedog extracts "
"message catalogs, merges translations, and builds for a chosen language. "
"The source text stays the reference. A missing translation falls back "
"rather than inventing text."
msgstr "翻译解释，保留结构。Guidedog 提取消息清单、合并译文，并按选定语言构建。源文本始终是参照，缺失的译文回退到源文，不凭空编造。"

#: ../../intl.rst:10
msgid "The workflow"
msgstr "工作流程"

#: ../../intl.rst:13
msgid "Write the message templates with the ``gettext`` builder:"
msgstr "使用 ``gettext`` 构建器生成消息模板："

#: ../../intl.rst:19
msgid ""
"It writes one template (``.pot``) per text domain into "
"``_build/gettext``: every paragraph, title, list item, table cell, "
"caption, admonition, term, and field of the documents becomes a message, "
"with the file and line it comes from."
msgstr ""
"它在 ``_build/gettext`` 中为每个文本域生成一个模板（\\ ``.pot``\\ "
"）。文档中的段落、标题、列表项、表格单元格、题注、提示框、术语和字段都会成为消息，并记录所在文件和行号。"

#: ../../intl.rst:23
msgid ""
"Create or update the catalogs of each language, as ``sphinx-intl update`` "
"does:"
msgstr "像 ``sphinx-intl update`` 一样，为各语言创建或更新清单："

#: ../../intl.rst:29
msgid ""
"The catalogs appear in ``locales/de/LC_MESSAGES/*.po``. On later runs the "
"command merges the new templates into them, as ``msgmerge`` does: "
"translations are kept, a message whose source changed gets the old "
"translation marked *fuzzy* for review, and messages no longer in the "
"documents are kept at the end as obsolete (``#~``), so a translation can "
"come back."
msgstr ""
"目录文件位于 ``locales/de/LC_MESSAGES/*.po``\\ 。再次运行时，命令会像 ``msgmerge`` "
"一样合并新模板：保留已有译文；源文改变时，将旧译文标为 *fuzzy*\\ ，供复核；已删除的消息作为废弃条目（\\ ``#~``\\ "
"）保留在末尾，以便日后恢复。"

#: ../../intl.rst:35
msgid ""
"Translate: fill in each ``msgstr``. Remove the ``#, fuzzy`` line of a "
"message once its translation is right; fuzzy translations are not used."
msgstr "填写每个 ``msgstr``\\ 。确认译文正确后，删除该消息的 ``#, fuzzy`` 行；构建时不会使用模糊译文。"

#: ../../intl.rst:43
msgid "See how far the translation is, as ``sphinx-intl stat`` does:"
msgstr "像 ``sphinx-intl stat`` 一样查看翻译进度："

#: ../../intl.rst:49
msgid "Build in the language:"
msgstr "按目标语言构建："

#: ../../intl.rst:56
msgid "or set ``language = \"de\"`` in ``conf.toml``."
msgstr "也可在 ``conf.toml`` 中设置 ``language = \"de\"``\\ 。"

#: ../../intl.rst:58
msgid ""
"Each book has a language suffix: ``manual.pdf`` becomes "
"``manual-de.pdf``. A build publishes one complete generation, so use "
"separate destinations to keep several editions. For example, build German "
"with ``guidedog build -b pdf docs build/books/de -D language=de`` and "
"English with ``guidedog build -b pdf docs build/books/en -D language=en``."
msgstr ""
"每本书都有语言后缀：\\ ``manual.pdf`` 会变为 ``manual-de.pdf``\\ "
"。一次构建发布一个完整版本，因此保留多语言版本时应使用不同目标目录。例如，德文用 ``guidedog build -b pdf docs "
"build/books/de -D language=de``\\ ，英文用 ``guidedog build -b pdf docs "
"build/books/en -D language=en``\\ 。"

#: ../../intl.rst:64
msgid ""
"Only the documents whose catalog changed are read again, as with any "
"other input of a document; adding or removing a catalog reads every "
"document again."
msgstr "与文档的其他输入相同，只有清单变化的文档才会重读；添加或删除清单时会重读所有文档。"

#: ../../intl.rst:67
msgid ""
"``guidedog intl`` takes sphinx-intl's options: ``-p DIR`` for the "
"templates (default ``_build/gettext``), ``-l LANG``, repeatable (default: "
"the project's language), ``-d DIR`` for the catalogs (default: the first "
"of ``locale_dirs``), ``-w N`` for the line width (default 76), and "
"``--no-obsolete``."
msgstr ""
"``guidedog intl`` 支持 sphinx-intl 的选项：\\ ``-p DIR`` 指定模板目录（默认 "
"``_build/gettext``\\ ）；\\ ``-l LANG`` 指定语言，可重复使用（默认为项目语言）；\\ ``-d DIR`` "
"指定目录文件位置（默认取 ``locale_dirs`` 的第一项）；\\ ``-w N`` 指定行宽（默认 76）；还支持 "
"``--no-obsolete``\\ 。"

#: ../../intl.rst:72
msgid "Writing translations"
msgstr "编写翻译"

#: ../../intl.rst:75
msgid ""
"A message is the source text of a paragraph, title, or other element, "
"with its markup: reStructuredText in ``.rst`` documents, Markdown in "
"``.md`` ones. A translation is read in the same markup, so it may "
"emphasize, link, and refer as the original does."
msgstr ""
"消息是段落、标题或其他元素的源文本，包含标记语法。\\ ``.rst`` 文档使用 reStructuredText，\\ ``.md`` "
"文档使用 Markdown。译文按同种语法读取，因此可保留原文的强调、链接和引用。"

#: ../../intl.rst:79
msgid ""
"References must stay the same. A translation keeps every reference of its "
"message, written the same way, and may only change the text around them "
"and their titles:"
msgstr "引用必须保持一致。译文保留消息中的每个引用及其写法，只改动周围文字和显示标题："

#: ../../intl.rst:87
msgid ""
"When a translation drops a reference, the build warns (``inconsistent "
"references in translated message``, as Sphinx does) and uses the "
"translation. When it names a reference the original does not have, it "
"could not be resolved, so the build warns and keeps the original text. A "
"translation whose markup the reader refuses is also kept in the original, "
"with a warning that quotes it."
msgstr ""
"译文缺少引用时，构建会像 Sphinx 一样发出警告（\\ ``inconsistent references in translated "
"message``\\ "
"），但仍采用译文。若译文引用了原文没有的目标，该引用无法解析，构建会警告并保留原文。若读取器拒绝译文标记，也会保留原文，并在警告中列出该译文。"

#: ../../intl.rst:93
msgid ""
"Section anchors do not change with the language: a translated title keeps "
"the anchor of its original, so links into the site, from inside and "
"outside, keep working."
msgstr "章节锚点不随语言变化。翻译后的标题保留原文锚点，因此站点内部和外部的链接仍然有效。"

#: ../../intl.rst:96
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../intl.rst:99
msgid ""
"The standard settings have Sphinx's names and defaults. Guidedog also "
"provides an extraction-only exclusion setting for untranslated reference "
"appendices."
msgstr "标准设置沿用 Sphinx 的名称和默认值。Guidedog 还提供仅用于提取的排除项，可让参考附录保持原文。"

#: ../../intl.rst:106
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置项"

#: ../../intl.rst:107
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../intl.rst:108
msgid "``language``"
msgstr "``language``"

#: ../../intl.rst:109
msgid "The language to build in, such as ``\"de\"`` or ``\"pt_BR\"``."
msgstr "构建语言，例如 ``\"de\"`` 或 ``\"pt_BR\"``\\ 。"

#: ../../intl.rst:110
msgid "``locale_dirs``"
msgstr "``locale_dirs``"

#: ../../intl.rst:111
msgid ""
"Where the catalogs are, relative to the source folder: each holds "
"``LANGUAGE/LC_MESSAGES/DOMAIN.po`` (or a compiled ``.mo``). Default "
"``[\"locales\"]``. With several, the first that translates a message wins."
msgstr ""
"相对于源目录的目录文件位置。每处包含 ``LANGUAGE/LC_MESSAGES/DOMAIN.po``\\ （或编译后的 ``.mo``\\ "
"）。默认是 ``[\"locales\"]``\\ 。指定多处时，采用第一个能翻译该消息的目录。"

#: ../../intl.rst:114
msgid "``gettext_compact``"
msgstr "``gettext_compact``"

#: ../../intl.rst:115
msgid ""
"Which catalog a document's messages go to. ``true`` (the default): a "
"document at the top level has its own, and the documents of a folder "
"share the folder's (``guide/usage.rst`` is in ``guide.po``). ``false``: "
"one catalog per document. A name: one catalog of that name for every "
"document."
msgstr ""
"决定文档消息所属的目录文件。\\ ``true``\\ （默认）：顶层文档各用一个目录文件，同一文件夹内的文档共用一个（\\ "
"``guide/usage.rst`` 使用 ``guide.po``\\ ）。\\ ``false``\\ "
"：每个文档一个。指定名称：所有文档共用该名称的目录文件。"

#: ../../intl.rst:119
msgid "``gettext_location``"
msgstr "``gettext_location``"

#: ../../intl.rst:120
msgid ""
"Write each message's locations (``#: ../../index.rst:12``). Default "
"``true``."
msgstr "写入消息位置（\\ ``#: ../../index.rst:12``\\ ），默认为 ``true``\\ 。"

#: ../../intl.rst:121
msgid "``gettext_uuid``"
msgstr "``gettext_uuid``"

#: ../../intl.rst:122
msgid ""
"Write an identifier per occurrence of a message. Guidedog makes them from "
"the document, the message, and its occurrence, so they are the same in "
"every build."
msgstr "为消息的每次出现写入标识符。Guidedog 根据文档、消息及出现位置生成，因此每次构建结果相同。"

#: ../../intl.rst:124
msgid "``gettext_auto_build``"
msgstr "``gettext_auto_build``"

#: ../../intl.rst:125
msgid ""
"Compile each ``.po`` into an ``.mo`` beside it, for other tools. Default "
"``true``. Guidedog itself reads the ``.po``."
msgstr ""
"将每个 ``.po`` 编译为旁边的 ``.mo``\\ ，供其他工具使用，默认为 ``true``\\ 。Guidedog 自身读取 "
"``.po``\\ 。"

#: ../../intl.rst:127
msgid "``gettext_additional_targets``"
msgstr "``gettext_additional_targets``"

#: ../../intl.rst:128
msgid ""
"More content to translate: ``index`` (index entries), ``literal-block``, "
"``doctest-block``, ``raw``, and ``image`` (alternative text)."
msgstr ""
"额外翻译内容：\\ ``index``\\ （索引项）、\\ ``literal-block``\\ 、\\ "
"``doctest-block``\\ 、\\ ``raw`` 和 ``image``\\ （替代文本）。"

#: ../../intl.rst:130
msgid "``gettext_allow_fuzzy_translations``"
msgstr "``gettext_allow_fuzzy_translations``"

#: ../../intl.rst:131
msgid "Use fuzzy translations too. Default ``false``."
msgstr "也使用模糊译文，默认为 ``false``\\ 。"

#: ../../intl.rst:132
msgid "``gettext_exclude_patterns``"
msgstr "``gettext_exclude_patterns``"

#: ../../intl.rst:133
msgid ""
"Document-path patterns omitted from POT extraction only, such as "
"``[\"api/**\"]``. Default ``[]``. The documents remain in HTML and PDF."
msgstr ""
"仅从 POT 提取中排除的文档路径模式，如 ``[\"api/**\"]``\\ 。默认为 ``[]``\\ 。文档仍保留在 HTML 和 PDF "
"中。"

#: ../../intl.rst:135
msgid "``gettext_last_translator``, ``gettext_language_team``"
msgstr "``gettext_last_translator``\\ , ``gettext_language_team``"

#: ../../intl.rst:136
msgid "The template header's ``Last-Translator`` and ``Language-Team``."
msgstr "模板头部的 ``Last-Translator`` 和 ``Language-Team``\\ 。"

#: ../../intl.rst:137
msgid "``figure_language_filename``"
msgstr "``figure_language_filename``"

#: ../../intl.rst:138
msgid ""
"The file of an image in the build's language. Default "
"``\"{root}.{language}{ext}\"``: with ``language = \"de\"``, "
"``img/logo.png`` becomes ``img/logo.de.png`` when that file exists. The "
"fields are ``{root}``, ``{path}``, ``{basename}``, ``{ext}``, "
"``{docpath}``, and ``{language}``."
msgstr ""
"构建语言对应的图片文件。默认 ``\"{root}.{language}{ext}\"``\\ ：若 ``language = "
"\"de\"``\\ ，且文件存在，\\ ``img/logo.png`` 会改用 ``img/logo.de.png``\\ 。可用字段为 "
"``{root}``\\ 、\\ ``{path}``\\ 、\\ ``{basename}``\\ 、\\ ``{ext}``\\ 、\\ "
"``{docpath}`` 和 ``{language}``\\ 。"

#: ../../intl.rst:142
msgid "``translation_progress_classes``"
msgstr "``translation_progress_classes``"

#: ../../intl.rst:143
msgid ""
"Give translated elements the class ``translated`` and the others "
"``untranslated`` (``true``), or only one of them (``\"translated\"``, "
"``\"untranslated\"``), so a stylesheet can show what is left."
msgstr ""
"给已翻译元素添加 ``translated`` 类，其他元素添加 ``untranslated`` 类（\\ ``true``\\ "
"）；也可只添加其中一种（\\ ``\"translated\"`` 或 ``\"untranslated\"``\\ ），以便用样式表显示翻译进度。"

#: ../../intl.rst:147
msgid "Guidedog's own words"
msgstr "Guidedog 的界面用语"

#: ../../intl.rst:150
msgid ""
"Guidedog writes some words itself: admonition titles, \"Added in version "
"2.1\", \"Fig. 1\", \"Contents\", the page layout's \"Previous\", "
"\"Next\", \"Navigation\", and \"Search\", the search and index pages, and "
"the book's \"Version\". They come from the text domain ``guidedog``, "
"looked up in this order:"
msgstr ""
"Guidedog 自身也生成文字：提示框标题、“Added in version 2.1”、“Fig. "
"1”、“Contents”，页面布局中的“Previous”、“Next”、“Navigation”和“Search”，搜索页和索引页，以及书籍中的“Version”。这些来自 "
"``guidedog`` 文本域，按以下顺序查找："

#: ../../intl.rst:155
msgid "``locales/LANGUAGE/LC_MESSAGES/guidedog.po`` of the project,"
msgstr "项目的 ``locales/LANGUAGE/LC_MESSAGES/guidedog.po``\\ 。"

#: ../../intl.rst:156
msgid ""
"``locales/LANGUAGE/LC_MESSAGES/sphinx.po`` of the project, as Sphinx "
"reads it,"
msgstr "项目的 ``locales/LANGUAGE/LC_MESSAGES/sphinx.po``\\ ，与 Sphinx 一致。"

#: ../../intl.rst:157
msgid ""
"the catalog built into Guidedog, for German, Spanish, French, Japanese, "
"Brazilian Portuguese, Russian, and Simplified Chinese."
msgstr "Guidedog 内置的清单，支持德语、西班牙语、法语、日语、巴西葡萄牙语、俄语及简体中文。"

#: ../../intl.rst:160
msgid ""
"The English words are the message identifiers, and they are Sphinx's "
"where Sphinx has the same word, so a project's ``sphinx.po`` keeps "
"working. A project can override any word, or add a language, with its own "
"``guidedog.po``."
msgstr ""
"消息标识符使用英文；Sphinx 有对应文字时，采用相同标识符，因此项目现有的 ``sphinx.po`` 仍可使用。项目自己的 "
"``guidedog.po`` 可以覆盖任意文字，或增加一种语言。"

#: ../../intl.rst:164
msgid ""
"Templates translate with ``_()``, ``gettext()``, and ``ngettext()``, as "
"Sphinx's templates do:"
msgstr "模板与 Sphinx 一样使用 ``_()``\\ 、\\ ``gettext()`` 和 ``ngettext()`` 翻译："

#: ../../intl.rst:172
msgid ""
"``numfig_format``, ``html_title``, and ``html_short_title`` follow the "
"language unless ``conf.toml`` sets them."
msgstr ""
"除非在 ``conf.toml`` 中明确设置，\\ ``numfig_format``\\ 、\\ ``html_title`` 和 "
"``html_short_title`` 会跟随语言。"

#: ../../intl.rst:175
msgid "Dates"
msgstr "日期"

#: ../../intl.rst:178
msgid ""
"``|today|``, the book's date, and a page's ``last_updated`` are formatted "
"as Sphinx formats them: ``today_fmt`` and ``html_last_updated_fmt`` are "
"``strftime`` formats, and the names of months and days follow "
"``language``, so ``%b %d, %Y`` is \"Sep 29, 2026\" in English and \"Sept. "
"29, 2026\" in German. An empty format is ``_('%b %d, %Y')``, which a "
"catalog may translate. The names come from the Unicode CLDR for the "
"languages above; other languages use English, as Sphinx does for a "
"language Babel does not know."
msgstr ""
"``|today|``\\ 、书籍日期和页面的 ``last_updated`` 采用 Sphinx 的格式规则：\\ ``today_fmt`` "
"和 ``html_last_updated_fmt`` 使用 ``strftime`` 格式，月份和星期名称遵循 ``language``\\ "
"。例如 ``%b %d, %Y`` 在英文中是“Sep 29, 2026”，在德文中是“Sept. 29, 2026”。空格式取 ``_('%b "
"%d, %Y')``\\ ，可由目录文件翻译。上述语言的名称来自 Unicode CLDR；其他语言使用英文，与 Sphinx 遇到 Babel "
"不支持的语言时相同。"

#: ../../intl.rst:185
msgid ""
"The date is the local date, in the local time zone. Set "
"``SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH`` (seconds since 1970, in UTC) to build reproducibly, "
"with the same dates on every machine."
msgstr ""
"日期取本地时区的本地日期。设置 ``SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH``\\ （自 1970 年起的 UTC "
"秒数），可实现可重复构建，使各机器使用相同日期。"
